Cell["\<\
The per-signal efficiency (%) and AUPRC arrays below are hand-transcribed \
evaluations of the original 250 Hz picks (the trials in originalPicks). They \
are kept in-notebook as the provenance record for the published tables -- do \
not regenerate them mechanically.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5d8e5617-1787-4285-bbed-d9514644a5d8"],

